    "FIRE A BARRAGE OF ENERGY THAT <style=cIsHealth>HARMS HOSTILE COMBATANTS</style> AND <style=cIsHealing>HEALS FRIENDLY COMBATANTS</style> FOR <style=cIsDamage>5x800%</style>. <style=cIsUtility>HOLD UP TO 3 CHARGES.</style>": "에너지 포화를 발사하여 <style=cIsHealth>적에게 피해를 주고</style> <style=cIsHealing>아군을 치유</style>합니다. 효과량은 <style=cIsDamage>5x800%</style>입니다. <style=cIsUtility>최대 3회 충전.</style>",
